@startuml
skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "メインマイコン" as MCU
actor "開発者 / 調整員" as Developer

package "VSCode Extension (IDE)" {
  [VSCode Extension UI] as ExtensionUI
}

package "gn10_navigation (ROS 2)" {
  [target_manager_node] as TargetManager
  [costmap_generator_node] as CostmapGen
  [path_planner_node] as Planner
  [path_follower_node] as Follower
}

database "nhk2026_map.json" as MapJson
database "shooting_points.yaml" as PointsYaml

' データの流れ
MapJson --> CostmapGen : フィールド形状・障害物定義
PointsYaml <--> TargetManager : 投擲ポイント永続化

MCU --> TargetManager : /robot/navigation_command (UInt8)\n/robot/target_id (UInt8)
TargetManager --> Planner : /goal_pose (PoseStamped)
CostmapGen --> Planner : /costmap (OccupancyGrid)

Planner --> Follower : /planned_path (Path)
Follower --> MCU : /robot/operation/navigation_status (UInt8)
Follower --> MCU : /robot/operation/cmd_vel (Twist)

' VSCode Extension との連携
Developer --> ExtensionUI : 投擲位置 Drag & Drop / 調整
ExtensionUI --> TargetManager : /target_manager/update_point (Service)\n/target_manager/save_points (Service)
ExtensionUI --> PointsYaml : Git Commit / History 読み込み
Follower --> [RViz2 (Debug)] : /debug/lookahead_point (Marker)

@enduml